{"page":187,"exact":true,"blocks":[{"x":0.72017,"y":0.05257,"w":0.23134,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"t":"3.7 隐函数求导 173"},{"x":0.39285,"y":0.10752,"w":0.52527,"h":0.06736,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"t":"隐函数求导 1. 对方程的两边关于 x 求导，将 y 视为 x 的可导函数。2. 将含有 dy/dx 的项移到方程的一边，并解出 dy/dx。"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.23824,"w":0.42267,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"t":"例题 3 求解 dy/dx，如果 y^2 = x^2 + sin(xy)（见图 3.31）。"},{"x":0.22645,"y":0.26351,"w":0.08666,"h":0.01461,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"t":"y^2 = x^2 + sin(xy)"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.27468,"w":0.33525,"h":0.01365,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"解 我们隐式地对方程求导。"},{"x":0.51204,"y":0.2934,"w":0.14429,"h":0.05118,"fs":0.01441,"n":3,"t":"y^2 = x^2 + sin(xy) d/dx(y^2) = d"},{"x":0.58323,"y":0.30868,"w":0.08306,"h":0.0359,"fs":0.01441,"n":1,"t":"d/dx(x^2) + d"},{"x":0.6545,"y":0.30868,"w":0.07124,"h":0.0359,"fs":0.01441,"n":1,"t":"d/dx(sin(xy))"},{"x":0.78301,"y":0.31748,"w":0.15234,"h":0.02302,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"t":"对两边关于 x 求导 c"},{"x":0.09637,"y":0.34924,"w":0.19424,"h":0.01078,"fs":0.01023,"n":5,"t":"0 2 4 −2 −4"},{"x":0.52575,"y":0.35104,"w":0.16231,"h":0.02973,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"2y dy/dx = 2x + (cos(xy)) d"},{"x":0.78301,"y":0.35312,"w":0.15853,"h":0.02357,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"t":"d/dx(xy)"},{"x":0.67627,"y":0.3607,"w":0.0449,"h":0.02009,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"−2"},{"x":0.17806,"y":0.37749,"w":0.01745,"h":0.01078,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"t":"2y dy/dx = 2x + (cos(xy)) ay + x dy"},{"x":0.52575,"y":0.38646,"w":0.21527,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"d/dx(b) 将 xy 视为乘积。"},{"x":0.72559,"y":0.38646,"w":0.16925,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"−4"},{"x":0.17806,"y":0.41197,"w":0.01745,"h":0.01078,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"t":"2y dy/dx - (cos(xy)) ax dy"},{"x":0.4043,"y":0.42266,"w":0.14393,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"d/dx(b) = 2x + (cos(xy)) y 收集含有 dy/dx 的项。"},{"x":0.53281,"y":0.42266,"w":0.38631,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"图 3.31 例题 3 中方程的图形。"},{"x":0.08775,"y":0.44567,"w":0.25883,"h":0.02762,"fs":0.01151,"n":3,"t":"(2y - x cos(xy)) dy"},{"x":0.4389,"y":0.45962,"w":0.11985,"h":0.02246,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"dx = 2x + y cos(xy)"},{"x":0.54332,"y":0.46861,"w":0.13123,"h":0.02074,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"dy/dx = 2x + y cos(xy)"},{"x":0.54332,"y":0.49515,"w":0.13131,"h":0.0304,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"dy/dx = 2x + y cos(xy)"},{"x":0.58323,"y":0.49904,"w":0.28733,"h":0.02644,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"2y - x cos(xy) 解出 dy/dx。"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.52574,"w":0.593,"h":0.05392,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"注意，dy/dx 的公式适用于隐式定义的曲线有斜率的任何地方。再次注意，导数涉及变量 x 和 y，而不仅仅是自变量 x。"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.6036,"w":0.20658,"h":0.01375,"fs":0.01375,"n":1,"t":"高阶导数"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.62826,"w":0.43124,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"隐函数求导也可以用来求高阶导数。"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.65618,"w":0.33195,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"t":"例题 4 如果 2x^3 - 3y^2 = 8，求 d^2y/dx^2。"},{"x":0.36259,"y":0.69263,"w":0.59302,"h":0.02899,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"解 首先，我们对方程的两边关于 x 求导，以找到 y′ = dy/dx。"},{"x":0.46,"y":0.73141,"w":0.13773,"h":0.0276,"fs":0.01401,"n":2,"t":"d/dx(2x^3 - 3y^2) = d"},{"x":0.58594,"y":0.73863,"w":0.03862,"h":0.02008,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"d/dx(8)"},{"x":0.48774,"y":0.75905,"w":0.39253,"h":0.01795,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"6x^2 - 6y y′ = 0 将 y 视为 x 的函数。"},{"x":0.54883,"y":0.78283,"w":0.05031,"h":0.02139,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"y′ = x^2"},{"x":0.58892,"y":0.79076,"w":0.22463,"h":0.01765,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"y ≠0 时求解 y′。"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.82146,"w":0.28406,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"我们现在应用商法则来求 y″。"},{"x":0.58218,"y":0.84086,"w":0.11806,"h":0.02802,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"y/dx = 2xy - x^2 y′"},{"x":0.55104,"y":0.8415,"w":0.04136,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"d/dx(x^2)"},{"x":0.76471,"y":0.84294,"w":0.0368,"h":0.03067,"fs":0.01918,"n":1,"t":"y^2 / y′"},{"x":0.72884,"y":0.84332,"w":0.04902,"h":0.02557,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"y - x^2"},{"x":0.51312,"y":0.84472,"w":0.04973,"h":0.01999,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"y″ = d"},{"x":0.65728,"y":0.84472,"w":0.08291,"h":0.02889,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"y^2 = 2x"},{"x":0.3626,"y":0.87219,"w":0.43087,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"最后，我们用 y′ = x^2/y 来表示 y″，使其以 x 和 y 的形式出现。"},{"x":0.57201,"y":0.90199,"w":0.03911,"h":0.03211,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"y^2 / x^2"},{"x":0.60091,"y":0.90199,"w":0.06067,"h":0.02739,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"y / x"},{"x":0.53615,"y":0.90381,"w":0.04902,"h":0.02557,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"y - x^2"},{"x":0.65023,"y":0.90381,"w":0.04902,"h":0.02557,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"y - x^4"},{"x":0.49414,"y":0.90521,"w":0.05336,"h":0.02001,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"y″ = 2x"},{"x":0.68609,"y":0.91175,"w":0.13439,"h":0.02227,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"y^3，当 y ≠0"}]}